    "sub_name": "計算機概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO  COMPUTER AND COMPUTING",
    "describe_ch": "電腦資訊與網路溝通技術的發展、已經全面地影響我們的生活方式、教育模式、互動與表達方式，本課程以\"數位校園\"為介紹的核心，引導新生融入校園的數位生活、善用數位教學平台、培養數位表達與溝通的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The developments of computer, information and web communication technology have impacted our life styles, educational modes, and interaction and communication abilities. This course will focus on introducing our digital campus to guild our freshmen enjoy digital life, digital learning and have the abilities to use digital tools for presentation and communication.",
